{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It has been over a month since your wife Maria Randers disappeared. You can feel it in your bones that she's stuck in the dark, mysterious Str\u00fcvat Laboratories.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/611639869a3e94d56983867a2d5f70c6.avif?t=1758735044\" width=64 height=64 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> hazardous environments with the help of unique <strong>audio-based equipment</strong> such as: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u29bf Sonar Guns<br>\u00a0\u29bf Path Systems\u00a0 \u00a0<br>\u00a0\u29bf Pulse Grenades  <br>\u00a0\u29bf Speaking Object Identifiers  <br>\u00a0\u29bf Rangefinders </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/67a0006a25db6785223f16cb6a30081e.avif?t=1758735044\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened in 2005 by reading hidden <strong>documents</strong> and badges. Learn about the employees and methods of the lab, maybe catch a hint of the unsettling elevator music playing in the cafeteria. And be sure to contact a supervisor if you hear any sounds in the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/90ad3530e2c08b49ed4bf8a890eaec50.avif?t=1758735044\" alt=\"icon showing sonar sound sweeping\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds Terrifying is a <strong>blind-accessible</strong> mystery horror game tested by people with all sight levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It plays similar to an FPS with short-range graphics, minigames, and an emphasis on <strong>spatial audio</strong> for headphones and unique methods of <strong>audio navigation.</strong> There are options to remove graphics, play with keyboard, modify TTS settings, (beta) controller and rebind support, and peaceful mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903920?t=1758735044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903920?t=1758735044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/ba220c3a4749123265cd3b37eed1db9cac5912a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758735044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/ba220c3a4749123265cd3b37eed1db9cac5912a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758735044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It has been over a month since your wife Maria Randers disappeared. You can feel it in your bones that she's stuck in the dark, mysterious Str\u00fcvat Laboratories.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/611639869a3e94d56983867a2d5f70c6.avif?t=1758735044\" width=64 height=64 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> hazardous environments with the help of unique <strong>audio-based equipment</strong> such as: </p><p clas